# profile: dspark-d4 — DSPARK with 4 draft tokens per step. The engine default
# is 8 (what baseline runs); the original "dspark-d8" profile turned out to be
# identical to baseline and now stands as a repeatability data point in
# docs/results.md.
# Hypothesis: earlier draft tokens are likelier to be accepted; fewer tokens
# per step means less draft/verify overhead under load. Compare vs baseline
# (d8) and vs mtp-flash (DFLASH d4).
SPEC_NUM_DRAFT_TOKENS=4
